      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get that i should see a doctor but i honestly don't have the time or the money for an urgent care visit right now. it's probably just a minor thing. i read online that oregano oil is a natural antibiotic and can be super effective if you just take more of it. if i took like 2000mg of oregano oil every few hours for a couple days, do you think that would be enough to knock out the bacteria? i just really need to know if i can handle this myself for now.",
